This package bundles ERC-7730 clear signing descriptors from the ERC-7730 registry,
https://github.com/LedgerHQ/clear-signing-erc7730-registry, in its `/registry` entry point
(src/registry/descriptors/, built to build/registry/descriptors/). They are copied byte for byte, at the commit and
with the SHA-256 recorded for each file in src/registry/manifest.json, by scripts/import-registry.mjs.

The registry's contents are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

ERC-7730 descriptors are rendered by @ethereum-sourcify/clear-signing,
https://github.com/sourcifyeth/clear-signing (MIT), a dependency installed beside this package and not bundled in it.

Each descriptor names its own owner in its metadata. A descriptor describes calls and messages in words its authors
chose; load it only if you trust the registry it comes from.
